# CURSOR RULES: ROADASAFE MOBILE APP (FLUTTER)

## Context
You are building the Mobile Application for "ROADASAFE" - an edge-sensing pothole detection app used by drivers.

## Tech Stack
- Framework: Flutter (Dart)
- Camera & AI Preview: `camera` package
- Location & Speed: `geolocator`
- Offline Database: `sqflite`
- Maps: `flutter_map`
- Icons: `lucide_icons`

## Core Screens
1. Onboarding (`UI-M00`): Permissions for Camera, GPS, & UU PDP Privacy.
2. Camera HUD (`UI-M01`): Real-time camera preview, bounding boxes, FPS, GPS status, Pause button.
3. History & Offline Queue (`UI-M02`): Local SQLite storage for offline scans, manual sync button.
4. Map View (`UI-M03`): OpenStreetMap displaying pothole severity markers.

## Guidelines
- Follow clean architecture: `lib/models/`, `lib/screens/`, `lib/widgets/`, `lib/services/`.
- Strictly match attached UI design references (UI-M00 to UI-M03).